UID:zurich-ai-safety-ai-futures-whats-the-plan-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261114T120410Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T200000
SUMMARY:AI Futures: What's the Plan?
LOCATION:ETH Zurich Main Building\, Rämistrasse 101\, Room F 26.5
DESCRIPTION:Fourth session of the AI Futures series\, turning from the risk
 s to the responses: technical safety work such as alignment\, control\, in
 terpretability and evaluations\; governance and policy including compute r
